DadStory_Text_MomSendoff::
	.string "MOM: {PLAYER}, you've grown up so fast.\p"
	.string "I always knew I'd see this day, but I\n"
	.string "didn't think it would come so soon.\p"
	.string "You know… you're so much like your dad.\p"
	.string "He wanted to become a GYM LEADER too…\n"
	.string "among other things.\p"
	.string "Of course, there was no GYM in PALLET\n"
	.string "TOWN when he was around.\p"
	.string "But it was always his ambition to become\n"
	.string "the best POKéMON TRAINER.\p"
	.string "You have a chance to do what he didn't.\n"
	.string "Go make him proud!$"

