	.string "LEADER journey going so far?\p"
	.string "I meant to give you something of your\n"
	.string "father's before you left, but I couldn't\l"
	.string "find it.\p"
	.string "I dug it up, though. Here, take a look.\p"
	.string "It's a special POKé BALL your dad made.\p"
	.string "I've told you how much he loved to work\n"
	.string "with his hands. Well, that's something he\l"
	.string "made.\p"
	.string "I guess it makes POKéMON a little\n"
	.string "stronger if they're inside it.\p"
	.string "Use it to catch a POKéMON to use in your\n"
	.string "GYM. Or maybe just hang on to it to\l"
	.string "remember him by.$"

