DadStory_Text_MomWhyWithHim::
	.string "MOM: Why were you with him…?\p"
	.string "Those aren't good people, you know that,\n"
	.string "right?\p"
	.string "They do more than just steal POKéMON.\n"
	.string "They corrupt them.\p"
	.string "They morph them into things they were\n"
	.string "never meant to be.\p"
	.string "Come here. I want to show you something.$"

DadStory_Text_MomBasement::
	.string "MOM: This is where your father did his\n"
	.string "work.\p"
	.string "I don't really know what all he got into,\n"
	.string "but he was down here day and night…\l"
	.string "tinkering.\p"
	.string "He didn't really like me coming down here,\n"
	.string "so I didn't.\p"
	.string "It scared me, {PLAYER}, at the height of\n"
	.string "it. He wasn't himself.\p"
	.string "He had strange visitors at all hours. I\n"
	.string "don't think he slept.\p"
	.string "When you were born, that all changed.\p"
	.string "I don't want you to ever think he didn't\n"
	.string "love you.\p"
	.string "You were the only thing that I thought\n"
	.string "could pull him out of his obsession.\p"
	.string "But he was in too deep…\p"
	.string "…\p"
	.string "You can come down here whenever you\n"
	.string "want. I should have told you about this\l"
	.string "earlier.$"

