DadStory_Text_GiovanniYourFather::
	.string "GIOVANNI: He tried to stop me too, you\n"
	.string "know.\p"
	.string "He did well. He took down much of the\n"
	.string "organization I built from within.\p"
	.string "But he paid the price.\p"
	.string "Do you know what he did, {PLAYER}? All\n"
	.string "the evil things he contributed to TEAM\l"
	.string "ROCKET?\p"
	.string "Ha. I bet you don't know the first thing\n"
	.string "about him.\p"
	.string "He was my top deputy. My best scientist.\n"
	.string "His inventions gave us unfathomable\l"
	.string "power!\p"
	.string "It was a shame when he defied me.\p"
	.string "Something about a “conscience,”\n"
	.string "treating POKéMON with “kindness” and\l"
	.string "not as a means for power.\p"
	.string "Blah, blah, blah. I shut him up, though.\n"
	.string "Used his own inventions against him.\p"
	.string "I tried to play nice with you. You're his\n"
	.string "child, after all.\p"
	.string "And he was such a good deputy, even if\n"
	.string "he was a little… soft.\p"
	.string "But I'm done playing nice.\p"
	.string "I'll show you my true power… the power\n"
	.string "your father gave me!$"

