DadStory_Text_GiovanniHow::
	.string "GIOVANNI: How?! Did you… did you use\n"
	.string "your father's inventions?\p"
	.string "He beat me in the end too. Not at first.\p"
	.string "He tried and tried and tried to do it\n"
	.string "without help, but eventually he\l"
	.string "succumbed to the allure of strength and\l"
	.string "power.\p"
	.string "He came back, one last time, with a team\n"
	.string "full of his creations.\p"
	.string "The strongest POKéMON I have ever\n"
	.string "seen…\p"
	.string "I wasn't even angry; I was in awe.\p"
	.string "And I was sure I could convince him to\n"
	.string "come back to help TEAM ROCKET.\p"
	.string "And just when I thought I'd worn him\n"
	.string "down, that's when it happened.\p"
	.string "His {STR_VAR_1} got angry, or scared, or\n"
	.string "confused, or something. Not that it\l"
	.string "matters.\p"
	.string "It attacked your father. And he didn't\n"
	.string "stand a chance.\p"
	.string "But that doesn't matter to me.\p"
	.string "He beat me once and TEAM ROCKET\n"
	.string "survived. His kid beating me is no\l"
	.string "different.\p"
	.string "Now get out of my…$"

DadStory_Text_MomLastTime::
	.string "MOM: This is the last time you hurt my\n"
	.string "family, GIOVANNI.\p"
	.string "The last time!$"

DadStory_Text_MomDadsChansey::
	.string "MOM: He created this POKéMON. This\n"
	.string "CHANSEY.\p"
	.string "After you were born… you inspired him.\p"
	.string "It was an attempt to heal all the damage\n"
	.string "he had done.\p"
	.string "It's strong, like the others, but it\n"
	.string "derives its strength from something not\l"
	.string "evil.\p"
	.string "It's a partner, a true friend.\p"
	.string "He gave it to me when he got… swept up in\n"
	.string "all this.\p"
	.string "And I've kept it all these years as a way\n"
	.string "to remember him.\p"
	.string "Those last few months, {PLAYER}, he was\n"
	.string "in shambles about what he'd done.\p"
	.string "You were born and it gave him a new\n"
	.string "perspective.\p"
	.string "He tried to make up for the years of pain\n"
	.string "he caused. And, in a way, he succeeded.\p"
	.string "He succeeded with you.\p"
	.string "What you did today, to finish the work\n"
	.string "that he started… he would have been so\l"
	.string "proud.\p"
	.string "Take this CHANSEY. It's yours now.\n"
	.string "That's what he would have wanted.\p"
	.string "Go battle the ELITE FOUR. Win your GYM.$"

