DadStory_Text_Note1::
	.string "NOTES ON SYNTHESIZER\n"
	.string "Finding: A strong acid is needed to\n"
	.string "strip away the known ability.\n"
	.string "Finding: All acids strong enough to\n"
	.string "strip an ability appear to knock the\n"
	.string "POKéMON out.\p"
	.string "Finding: Implantation is simpler on a\n"
	.string "knocked-out POKéMON. Combine acid\n"
	.string "wash with reprogramming step to\n"
	.string "achieve desired result.\p"
	.string "Finding: Successful implantation of\n"
	.string "new ability on a RATTATA. Upon\n"
	.string "revival, POKéMON appears much less\n"
	.string "friendly. Will monitor further.$"

DadStory_Text_Note2::
	.string "NOTES ON BALL MAKER, PART 1\n"
	.string "Finding: POKéMON appear to exhibit\n"
	.string "increased strength surrounded by\n"
	.string "POKéMON of their type. Potential\n"
	.string "opportunity to harness this\n"
	.string "phenomenon.\p"
	.string "Finding: Testing group of METAPOD.\n"
	.string "Strength gains appear to be limited\n"
	.string "to Attack stat, which was previously\n"
	.string "METAPOD's weakest. Monitor further.\p"
	.string "Finding: Increased Attack appears to\n"
	.string "remain with as little as two METAPOD\n"
	.string "together.$"

DadStory_Text_Note3::
	.string "NOTES ON BALL MAKER, PART 2\n"
	.string "Finding: Unintended battle occurred\n"
	.string "when METAPOD used its increased\n"
	.string "Attack to knock out another\n"
	.string "METAPOD. Gains appear to remain even\n"
	.string "after other POKéMON is knocked out.\p"
	.string "Finding: Knocked-out METAPOD did not\n"
	.string "recover. Attack stat remains\n"
	.string "elevated in surviving METAPOD.$"

DadStory_Text_Note4::
	.string "LAB VISITOR\n"
	.string "Invited BILL to see lab. He was… not\n"
	.string "impressed.\p"
	.string "Thinks this type of work will get me\n"
	.string "caught up with the wrong people.\n"
	.string "Thinks I should live with the\n"
	.string "POKéMON, not manipulate them.\p"
	.string "He even mentioned trying to become a\n"
	.string "POKéMON. Lunatic…$"

DadStory_Text_Notebook::
