	.string "1. APPLE JUICE has the same effect\n"
	.string "as STRONG ACID in removing a\n"
	.string "POKéMON's current ability.\p"
	.string "They also appear to enjoy the taste\n"
	.string "so much that implantation of\n"
	.string "synthetic ability can be performed\n"
	.string "without resistance.\p"
	.string "2. After further experiments, it has\n"
	.string "been determined that POKéMON do not\n"
	.string "need to have expired to gather\n"
	.string "enough material to create a TYPE\n"
	.string "BALL with the same effects.\p"
	.string "BALL MAKER has been modified to\n"
	.string "painlessly extract a small amount of\n"
	.string "a POKéMON's DNA to apply to the ball.\p"
	.string "Operate SWITCH in lab to toggle\n"
	.string "modes for these two machines.$"
